# Dependencies
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
yarn.lock
pnpm-lock.yaml

# package-lock.json IS committed. It was ignored, which meant CI could not run
# `npm ci` and would have resolved different dependency versions than local
# builds -- so a green CI run would not have proven the thing you actually
# ship. A lockfile is the record of what was verified.

