# Derived responsive images ARE COMMITTED, deliberately. The encoder is
# macOS-only (sips) and Vercel builds on Linux, so gitignoring them would mean
# production silently ships no AVIF/WebP and falls through to the ~529 kB PNG.
# Regenerate with `npm run build:images` on macOS and commit the result.
